      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The spined renkroda's spines are bristled</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The spined renkroda would be hit by a ranged Strike, but the damage hasn't been rolled yet</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The spined renkroda twists its body, deflecting part of the attack with its spines, and gains resistance 10 to the triggering damage. Its spines are no longer bristled.</p>",
